"lh_e568e2_old":"\u20ba1.199","lh_a168_price":"sadece \u20ba1019,15","lh_e568e2_save":"(\u20ba179.85 indirim)","lh_8huk_link":"HEMEN S\u0130PAR\u0130\u015e VER","lh_a168_desc_html":"Stok<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"CHvg0I9UG6":{"lh_a168_title":"S\u0131k\u00e7a Sorulan Sorular (SSS)","lh_ezc4q5_name":"Kollajen ne i\u015fe yarar?","lh_ezc4q5_content_html":"Kollajen takviyeleri, kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rabilir, kemik kayb\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nleyebilir, eklem a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 hafifletebilir, k\u0131r\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131 ve kurulu\u011fu azaltarak cilt sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirebilir, t\u0131rnaklar\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir ve daha zor k\u0131r\u0131lmalar\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flayabilir, sa\u00e7 d\u00f6k\u00fclmesini azaltabilir ve sa\u00e7 k\u00f6klerini g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezhhnw_name":"Kollajen tipleri nelerdir? Hangi tipler faydal\u0131d\u0131r?","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"28 \u00c7e\u015fit Kollajen vard\u0131r ancak bunlardan sadece Tip 1, Tip 2, Tip 3 klinik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalara konu olmu\u015f ve etkileri kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. \n- Tip I: T\u00fcm ba\u011f dokular\u0131nda bulunan en yayg\u0131n tiptir.\n- Tip II: eklemlerde ve omurlararas\u0131 disklerde bulunur \n- Tip III: Cildinizde ve kan damarlar\u0131n\u0131zda bulunan retik\u00fcler liflerin ana bile\u015fenidir.\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezmuln_name":"Kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131ran vitamin ve mineraller nelerdir?","lh_ezmuln_content_html":"Sadece Kollajen i\u00e7eren takviyeleri kullanmak her zaman yeterli olmayabilir. C Vitamini, \u00c7inko, E Vitamini, Selenyum, Koenzim Q10 v\u00fccuttaki kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131r\u0131r ve kollajenin etkilerini h\u0131zland\u0131r\u0131r. Buna ek olarak, Glutatyon, Hyaluronik Asit, Alfa-Lipoik Asit ise cilde nem veren ve gen\u00e7le\u015fmesini sa\u011flayan bile\u015fenlerdir ve Kollajen ile birlikte kullan\u0131m\u0131 cildinize \u00f6zel faydalar sa\u011flar.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezs7je_name":"G\u00fcnde ka\u00e7 kez kullanmal\u0131y\u0131m?","lh_ezs7je_content_html":"G\u00fcnde 1 sa\u015fe, sabah veya yatmadan \u00f6nce kullanmal\u0131s\u0131n\u0131z.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezxkh5_name":"A\u00e7 karna m\u0131, tok karna m\u0131 kullan\u0131lmal\u0131?","lh_ezxkh5_content_html":"Kolajeni sabahlar\u0131 a\u00e7 karn\u0131na veya gece yatmadan \u00f6nce alabilirsiniz. Gece kullan\u0131yorsan\u0131z, son yeme\u011finizden en az 1-2 saat sonra i\u00e7meniz, kolajenin etkisini art\u0131rmaya yard\u0131mc\u0131 olur.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f02xew_name":"Nas\u0131l haz\u0131rlan\u0131r?","lh_f02xew_content_html":"Sa\u015fe i\u00e7eri\u011fini bir bardak suya d\u00f6k\u00fcn,&nbsp; kar\u0131\u015ft\u0131r\u0131p i\u00e7in.&nbsp;<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f08acn_name":"Yan etkisi var m\u0131?","lh_f08acn_content_html":"Vitacoral Collagen'in beklenen ve g\u00f6zlemlenen herhangi bir yan etkisi yoktur. \n\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0dnae_name":"Kollajen ka\u00e7 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren kullan\u0131lmal\u0131?","lh_f0dnae_content_html":"Yap\u0131lan ara\u015ft\u0131rmalara g\u00f6re, v\u00fccut 25-30 ya\u015flar\u0131ndan sonra kolajen \u00fcretmemeye ba\u015flar ve yirmili ya\u015flardan itibaren her sene %1 kolajen kaybeder. Bu sebeple 25 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren senede en az 3-6 ay kolajen kullan\u0131lmas\u0131 \u00f6nerilmektedir. Vitacoral Collagen 25 ya\u015f\u0131ndan itibaren kollajen \u00fcretimini art\u0131rmak amac\u0131yla kullan\u0131labilir. Buna ek olarak, Vitacoral Collagen kullan\u0131m\u0131nda herhangi bir ya\u015f s\u0131n\u0131r yoktur.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0j085_name":"Ne kadar s\u00fcrede etkisini g\u00f6sterir?","lh_f0j085_content_html":"Kollajen takviyeleri ile ilgili yap\u0131lan klinik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalar sonucunda minimum 12 Hafta d\u00fczenli kullan\u0131m sonucunda en y\u00fcksek etkiyi g\u00f6sterece\u011fi g\u00f6zlemlenmi\u015ftir. Bu s\u00fcre, beslenme al\u0131\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131 ve g\u00fcne\u015f \u0131\u015f\u0131nlar\u0131n\u0131n ciltteki etkisine g\u00f6re uzayabilir.\nBununla birlikte, Vitacoral Collagen i\u00e7eri\u011findeki 14 yard\u0131mc\u0131 hammadde sayesinde, ilk ay kullan\u0131m\u0131n sonunda sa\u00e7 d\u00f6k\u00fclmesinde azalma, cilte parlakl\u0131k ve canl\u0131l\u0131k, eklem a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131nda azalma gibi etkiler g\u00f6stermesi beklenir.\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_f0od5w_name":"Bal\u0131k kollajeni ve s\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajenin fark\u0131 nedir?","lh_f0od5w_content_html":"Pratikte, s\u0131\u011f\u0131r ve deniz kollajeni aras\u0131nda asl\u0131nda \u00e7ok b\u00fcy\u00fck bir fark yoktur ve her ikisinin de faydalar\u0131 vard\u0131r. \n\u0130simlerinden de anla\u015f\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 gibi, bunlar farkl\u0131 kaynaklardan t\u00fcretilmi\u015ftir.\nS\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajeni ineklerden gelir. Deniz kollajeni ise bal\u0131ktan gelir (esas olarak pullardan ve kemiklerden). \nS\u0131\u011f\u0131r kollajeni, her ikisi de insan v\u00fccudunda yayg\u0131n olarak bulunan tip I ve tip III kollajen i\u00e7erir. \nBal\u0131k kollajeni de benzer faydalar\u0131 sa\u011flamaktad\u0131r. \u00d6te yandan, Tip 2 Kollajen ise tavuktan elde edilir.\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ki54mq_name":"Kemik suyundan yeterli kollajeni al\u0131r m\u0131y\u0131m?","lh_ki54mq_content_html":"Kemik suyu, ilik suyu veya pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131 gibi yiyeceklerde kollajen bulunur ancak bu besinleri t\u00fcketerek yeterli kollajeni almak m\u00fcmk\u00fcn de\u011fildir. 1 kase pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131nda 3.8mg ile 17.6mg aras\u0131nda kollajen bulunur ve g\u00fcnl\u00fck kollajen ihtiyac\u0131 minimum 7.000 mg'dir. Ayr\u0131ca, bu kollajen hidrolize formda olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emilimi \u00e7ok zordur. \nVitacoral collagen sadece suda m\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcr?\nHay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen'i kahve, mevye suyu, yo\u011furt ve tatl\u0131lara ekleyerek de kullanabilirsiniz.\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kiahkh_name":"Vitaoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131r\u0131r m\u0131?","lh_kiahkh_content_html":"Hay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131rmaz. Vitacoral Collagen \u015eeker, Yapay Tatland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 ve Gluten \u0130\u00e7ermez. Bir sa\u015fede sadece 32 kalori i\u00e7erir. Bununla birlikte, Vitacoral Collagen zengin i\u00e7eri\u011fi sayesinde kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rmaya ve ya\u011f yak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 h\u0131zland\u0131rmaya destek olur. <!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kifui8_name":"Vitacoral Collagen'i kimler kullanabilir?","lh_kifui8_content_html":"Vitacoral Collagen \u015feker i\u00e7ermeyen form\u00fcl\u00fc sayesinde diabet hastalar\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131labilir.  Hamile veya emziren kad\u0131nlar\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131nda her hangi bir sak\u0131nca yoktur ancak yine de doktorunuza dan\u0131\u015farak kullanman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"32nirixxy3d":{"lh_a168_title":"S\u0131k\u00e7a Sorulan Sorular (SSS)","lh_ezc4q5_name":"Kollajen ne i\u015fe yarar?","lh_ezc4q5_content_html":"Kollajen takviyeleri, kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rabilir, kemik kayb\u0131n\u0131 \u00f6nleyebilir, eklem a\u011fr\u0131lar\u0131n\u0131 hafifletebilir, k\u0131r\u0131\u015f\u0131kl\u0131klar\u0131 ve kurulu\u011fu azaltarak cilt sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 iyile\u015ftirebilir, t\u0131rnaklar\u0131 g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir ve daha zor k\u0131r\u0131lmalar\u0131n\u0131 sa\u011flayabilir, sa\u00e7 d\u00f6k\u00fclmesini azaltabilir ve sa\u00e7 k\u00f6klerini g\u00fc\u00e7lendirebilir.<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ezhhnw_name":"Kollajen tipleri nelerdir? Hangi tipler faydal\u0131d\u0131r?","lh_ezhhnw_content_html":"28 \u00c7e\u015fit Kollajen vard\u0131r ancak bunlardan sadece Tip 1, Tip 2, Tip 3 klinik \u00e7al\u0131\u015fmalara konu olmu\u015f ve etkileri kan\u0131tlanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r. \n- Tip I: T\u00fcm ba\u011f dokular\u0131nda bulunan en yayg\u0131n tiptir.\n- Tip II: eklemlerde ve omurl