!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_ki54mq_name":"Kemik suyundan yeterli kollajeni al\u0131r m\u0131y\u0131m?","lh_ki54mq_content_html":"Kemik suyu, ilik suyu veya pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131 gibi yiyeceklerde kollajen bulunur ancak bu besinleri t\u00fcketerek yeterli kollajeni almak m\u00fcmk\u00fcn de\u011fildir. 1 kase pa\u00e7a \u00e7orbas\u0131nda 3.8mg ile 17.6mg aras\u0131nda kollajen bulunur ve g\u00fcnl\u00fck kollajen ihtiyac\u0131 minimum 7.000 mg'dir. Ayr\u0131ca, bu kollajen hidrolize formda olmad\u0131\u011f\u0131ndan emilimi \u00e7ok zordur. \nVitacoral collagen sadece suda m\u0131 \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcn\u00fcr?\nHay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen'i kahve, mevye suyu, yo\u011furt ve tatl\u0131lara ekleyerek de kullanabilirsiniz.\n<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kiahkh_name":"Vitacoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131r\u0131r m\u0131?","lh_kiahkh_content_html":"Hay\u0131r, Vitacoral Collagen kilo ald\u0131rmaz. Vitacoral Collagen \u015eeker, Yapay Tatland\u0131r\u0131c\u0131 ve Gluten \u0130\u00e7ermez. Bir sa\u015fede sadece 32 kalori i\u00e7erir. Bununla birlikte, Vitacoral Collagen zengin i\u00e7eri\u011fi sayesinde kas k\u00fctlesini art\u0131rmaya ve ya\u011f yak\u0131m\u0131n\u0131 h\u0131zland\u0131rmaya destek olur. <!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_kifui8_name":"Vitacoral Collagen'i kimler kullanabilir?","lh_kifui8_content_html":"Vitacoral Collagen \u015feker i\u00e7ermeyen form\u00fcl\u00fc sayesinde diabet hastalar\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan kullan\u0131labilir.  Hamile veya emziren kad\u0131nlar\u0131n kullan\u0131m\u0131nda her hangi bir sak\u0131nca yoktur ancak yine de doktorunuza dan\u0131\u015farak kullanman\u0131z\u0131 \u00f6neririz.<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"hqww3hc5tf8":{"lh_5oj_heading":"Bilim Ne Diyor?","lh_ox7t03_title":"\ud83d\udd38Kolajen Tip 1-2-3: Yap\u0131lan ara\u015ft\u0131rmalar, Tip 1 ve 3 kolajenin cilt elastikiyeti ve nem dengesini art\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131; Tip 2 kolajenin ise eklem sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 destekledi\u011fini g\u00f6stermektedir.","lh_ox7t03_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17 J Clin Aesthet Dermatol, 2019<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_oxd5xu_title":"\ud83d\udd38 Hyaluronik Asit: Topikal ve oral formda kullan\u0131lan hyaluronik asidin ciltte nem tutma kapasitesini art\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131, b\u00f6ylece dolgun ve p\u00fcr\u00fczs\u00fcz bir g\u00f6r\u00fcn\u00fcm sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 saptanm\u0131\u015ft\u0131r","lh_oxd5xu_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17Dermato-Endocrinology, 2012<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_oxiivl_title":"\ud83d\udd38 C Vitamini: Kolajen sentezinde rol alan C vitamini, ayn\u0131 zamanda antioksidan etkisiyle cilt tonunu e\u015fitleyip parlakl\u0131k kazand\u0131r\u0131r.","lh_oxiivl_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17 Nutrients, 2017<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_oxnvtc_title":"\ud83d\udd38 Alfa Lipoik Asit (ALA): ALA'n\u0131n hem suda hem ya\u011fda \u00e7\u00f6z\u00fcnebilen bir antioksidan olmas\u0131, onu ya\u015flanma kar\u015f\u0131t\u0131 etkilerde etkili bir ajan haline getirir.","lh_oxnvtc_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17 Free Radic Biol Med, 2010<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_oxt8r3_title":"\ud83d\udd38 Glutatyon: Cildin parlakl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 art\u0131ran ve detoksifikasyon s\u00fcre\u00e7lerine katk\u0131 sa\u011flayan glutatyon, oral al\u0131mda da etkili oldu\u011fu g\u00f6sterilen bir antioksidand\u0131r.","lh_oxt8r3_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17 Clin Cosmet Investig Dermatol, 2017<!--lh-live-editor-->","lh_oxylou_title":"\ud83d\udd38 Koenzim Q10: Ciltte enerji \u00fcretiminde rol oynayan KoQ10\u2019un topikal ve oral kullan\u0131mda elastikiyet ve nem art\u0131\u015f\u0131 sa\u011flad\u0131\u011f\u0131 bulunmu\u015ftur.","lh_oxylou_des_html":"\ud83d\udd17 BioFactors, 2009<!--lh-live-editor-->"},"68kwfaa4qxc":{"lh_5oj_heading":"Bilim Ne Diyor?","lh_ox7t03_title":"\ud83d\udd38Kolajen Tip 1-2-3: Yap\u0131lan ara\u015ft\u0131rmalar, Tip 1 ve 3 kolajenin cilt elastikiyeti ve nem dengesini art\u0131rd\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131; Tip 2 kolajenin ise eklem sa\u011fl\u0131\u011f\u0131n\u0131 dest